<title>HONG KONG: Wing Lung Bank in HK$150 mln placement.</title>
<headline>Wing Lung Bank in HK$150 mln placement.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wing Lung Bank's HK$150 million floating rate certificate of deposit issue has been privately placed, bankers said on Friday.</p>
<p>The issue is due on May 12, 1998, and is priced at par to float at 22.5 basis points over the three-month Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>Payment date is May 12.</p>
<p>Societe Generale Asia is the mandated arranger.</p>
<p>The FRCDs are issued from a HK$3 billion certificate of deposit programme.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
